              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orwo Balaamu yaboine okwo Omukama alikugonza k'aha Abaisiraeli omugisha, tiyagenzire nk'okwo yabaire yagenzire mirundi endijo kubaza. Amaisho agahanga omw'irungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aleba, abona okwo Abaisiraeli basisiire, buli ruganda harwo. Aho Ruhanga amwija aha mutwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanza kuranga ati,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaki akwatirwa Balaamu ekiniga kingi, atera oruganja. Amugambira ati, “Nkwesire kundaamira ababisha bange, mbwenu wagobya emirundi eshatu nobaha omugisha? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aha rw'ekyo iruka oshube omuka. Ngambire okwo ndakuha ekitinwa, kyonkai Omukama yakwimisa ekitinwa ekyo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balaamu abaza Balaki ati, “Entumwa zowantumireho tinazigambiire nti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘N'orwo Balaki yakumpa enjuye eijwire efeza n'ezahabu, tinakuchwa muhango gwa Mukama kukora okwo nayenda na kirungi na kibi; nkagamba okwo ekyo Omukama alikugamba nikyo ndagamba?’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
